      "id": "u2LGS5SNvnLiXpgx",
      "name": "Verduran Ambush",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "u2LGS5SNvnLiXpgx",
        "folder": "mLlFlndFIxI0g6U0",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Verduran Ambush",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 3
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You prepare to ambush a foe. You Ready an activity that takes 2 actions, though that activity must either be Death from Above or an activity with the requirement that you be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Hidden] or @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Undetected] by all your opponents (such as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Scout's Pounce]). After using the reaction, you cannot use this feat again for 10 minutes.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 6
          },
